APP BankSOX multi-cloud aws gcp

USE swift PIN 3.0.1
USE kyc PIN 2.0.0

HAVE Account with id uuid balance decimal secure owner string
HAVE Wire with id uuid from uuid to uuid amount decimal status enum

DO Wire and approval from 2 CFO circuit idempotent audit
 IF amount > 10000
 REQUIRE approval from CFO, CRO
 Call swift.send from to amount
 DO Log and immutable

WHEN daily DO SOX_Report and bulk
 FOR EACH Wire DO Export to S3 WORM

DO GDPR delete user and audit
